WEBVTT

00:00:01.252 --> 00:00:05.464
Ima kara utau koto koko dake no hanashi ni

00:00:06.924 --> 00:00:08.926
<i>Shite oite ne</i>

00:00:09.010 --> 00:00:14.724
<i>Yokubou wa kokoro ni
kakushite okitai no hontou wa</i>

00:00:14.807 --> 00:00:16.851
<i>Himitsu himitsu</i>

00:00:33.117 --> 00:00:35.703
<i>Chikamichi shitai</i>

00:00:35.786 --> 00:00:39.582
<i>Ame ni nureru koto naku</i>

00:00:39.665 --> 00:00:43.211
Kaze ni tobasareru koto naku

00:00:43.294 --> 00:00:47.006
Zurugashikokute mo waratte ne

00:00:47.089 --> 00:00:51.469
<i>Hikyoumono demo asonde ne</i>

00:00:52.470 --> 00:00:55.056
Kanashimitakunai

00:00:55.139 --> 00:00:58.935
Namida ni nureru koto naku

00:00:59.018 --> 00:01:02.563
<i>Tohou ni kureru koto</i> naku

00:01:02.647 --> 00:01:06.025
Donkan datte waratte ne

00:01:06.108 --> 00:01:11.072
<i>Tanoshii koto dake oshiete ne</i>

00:01:14.825 --> 00:01:19.372
<i>Mitai kao ga aru no kikitai koe ga aru no</i>

00:01:20.581 --> 00:01:24.252
Me <i>ga</i> sametara yorokobi wo narashite

00:01:24.335 --> 00:01:30.299
<i>Ohayou, kyou mo yoroshiku onegai itashimasu</i>

00:01:30.299 --> 00:01:30.967
"Princess Jellyfish"

00:01:39.308 --> 00:01:42.561
Burn! Burn!

00:01:42.645 --> 00:01:45.189
Banba, when you bake a sweet potato,

00:01:45.273 --> 00:01:48.484
aren't you supposed to put the
potato in before you start the fire?

00:01:48.567 --> 00:01:50.361
No worries.

00:01:52.613 --> 00:01:54.156
Banba's head is on fire!

00:01:54.240 --> 00:01:55.157
--Mom, today the Sisterhood and
<i>I</i> baked sweet potatoes from Dad's farm.

00:01:55.157 --> 00:01:57.410
<i>“Oh, no worries. --Mom, today the Sisterhood
and I baked sweet potatoes from</i> Dad's <i>farm.</i>

00:01:57.410 --> 00:01:59.829
--Mom, today the Sisterhood and
<i>I</i> baked sweet potatoes from Dad's farm.

00:01:59.829 --> 00:02:01.038
<i>“Pond! --Mom, today the Sisterhood and I
baked sweet potatoes from Dad's farm.</i>

00:02:01.038 --> 00:02:02.873
--Nwo blorweez. --Mom, today the Sisterhood
and <i>I</i> baked sweet potatoes from Dad's farm.

00:02:02.957 --> 00:02:04.333
Quenched!

00:02:04.417 --> 00:02:05.876
That smells delicious...

00:02:05.960 --> 00:02:10.631
<i>We used to do bonfires all
the time as</i> a <i>family, didn't we?</i>

00:02:10.715 --> 00:02:13.092
Yeah... Like that day...

00:02:14.051 --> 00:02:17.305
Want to gather firewood with me, Tsukimi?

00:02:17.388 --> 00:02:18.556
Yeah!

00:02:18.639 --> 00:02:20.933
Hey, don't push yourself too hard.

00:02:21.017 --> 00:02:22.893
No worries, dear.

00:02:22.977 --> 00:02:29.025
Mom, look! There's a
bunch of driftwood over here!

00:02:29.108 --> 00:02:33.779
Driftwood burns really great, huh?
I'll get us a bunch!

00:02:33.863 --> 00:02:36.824
Wow, Tsukimi, I'm impressed you know so much!

00:02:38.159 --> 00:02:40.494
'Course I do! We had a bonfire last year, too!

00:02:41.871 --> 00:02:47.543
Wow, Mom, look how big that one is!

00:02:47.626 --> 00:02:49.003
<i>Mom'?</i>

00:02:57.553 --> 00:03:03.476
<i>That was years ago, but I still can't deal with it.</i>

00:03:03.559 --> 00:03:07.772
<i>I still wind up crying over stuff like this.</i>

00:03:07.855 --> 00:03:11.650
<i>Days like these, I always</i>
want <i>to go see the jellyfish.</i>

00:03:12.401 --> 00:03:15.321
<i>"I'll</i> See You in My Aquarium"

00:03:17.365 --> 00:03:22.119
"Amamizu Station Area Urban Renewal"
"'Active City Amamizu' Plan"

00:03:22.119 --> 00:03:22.745
<i>are against the redevelopment...</i>

00:03:22.828 --> 00:03:25.206
<i>Something to just keep an eye on for now.</i>

00:03:25.831 --> 00:03:27.249
Bro!

00:03:27.333 --> 00:03:29.377
I've told you not to come in without knocking.

00:03:29.460 --> 00:03:31.629
I went into the old man's room, too.

00:03:31.712 --> 00:03:34.006
You searched the house again, didn't you?

00:03:34.090 --> 00:03:38.010
Yep. But I didn't find Mom's address.

00:03:38.094 --> 00:03:42.890
Must be rough on you, brother dear,
having to work on your day off.

00:03:42.890 --> 00:03:44.725
"Amamizu Station Area Urban Renewal"
"'Active City Amamizu' Plan"

00:03:46.352 --> 00:03:49.021
That building's part of the
area slated for redevelopment.

00:03:49.105 --> 00:03:51.273
They're planning to
build a high-rise hotel there.

00:03:53.359 --> 00:03:55.111
This is no time to eat potatoes!

00:03:55.194 --> 00:03:57.488
Put them down!
Everybody put down your potato!

00:03:57.571 --> 00:03:59.532
Now look at this!

00:03:59.615 --> 00:04:01.158
These are top-secret documents!

00:04:01.242 --> 00:04:03.160
They say in the redevelopment
two years from now,

00:04:03.244 --> 00:04:05.996
this place will get turned
into a high-rise hotel!

00:04:06.080 --> 00:04:07.957
Redevelopment?

00:04:08.040 --> 00:04:09.834
High-rise hotel?

00:04:17.049 --> 00:04:19.718
Aw, that'll be fine.

00:04:19.802 --> 00:04:20.511
Right?

00:04:20.553 --> 00:04:21.429
Of course!

00:04:21.512 --> 00:04:24.473
Your positive thinking has no basis in reality!

00:04:24.557 --> 00:04:28.727
What are you going to do
without this place? You're all NEETs!

00:04:28.811 --> 00:04:32.231
--We're not NEETs. We're free spirits. --It's really hard
for a NEET to rent an apartment these days, you know!

00:04:32.314 --> 00:04:36.068
And it'd be a waste for a retro
building like this to get torn down!

00:04:36.152 --> 00:04:38.571
It won't be!

00:04:38.654 --> 00:04:40.656
The Nunnery will live forever!

00:04:40.739 --> 00:04:43.576
God may forgive its destruction, but I won't!

00:04:43.659 --> 00:04:45.411
It's all right, Mayaya!

00:04:45.494 --> 00:04:47.413
The redevelopment is
still in its planning stages,

00:04:47.496 --> 00:04:50.082
and the protesters are working hard against it!

00:04:50.166 --> 00:04:52.001
Wait, you knew?

00:04:52.084 --> 00:04:55.754
Sure, even we read the ward newsletter.

00:04:55.838 --> 00:04:57.131
Because we live in the ward.

00:04:57.214 --> 00:05:00.468
It'll be fine! So don't cry, Mayaya.

00:05:00.551 --> 00:05:06.140
"Better to wrong the world than
have it wrong me!" --by Cao Cao

00:05:08.142 --> 00:05:11.353
It was stupid of me to
expect a sensible response.

00:05:11.437 --> 00:05:17.109
Um, p-please go home...
like I'm always asking you to...

00:05:17.193 --> 00:05:21.572
I'm planning to go out for a bit.

00:05:21.655 --> 00:05:23.866
Now that's unusual! Where are you going?

00:05:23.949 --> 00:05:24.742
Shopping?

00:05:24.783 --> 00:05:28.078
T-To an aquarium, to see the jellyfish...

00:05:28.162 --> 00:05:31.040
I'll come with you!
I've got nothing better to do.

00:05:31.123 --> 00:05:33.918
No, no! It's not nearby!

00:05:34.001 --> 00:05:37.588
It's the Enoshima Aquarium
in Shonan, so it's far away!

00:05:37.671 --> 00:05:40.341
Oh, come on, that's nothing if we go by car!

00:05:40.424 --> 00:05:42.968
Let's borrow my big brother's Benz.
With a driver included!

00:05:43.052 --> 00:05:43.677
Huh?!

00:05:43.719 --> 00:05:46.889
We'll do your big transformation like before.

00:05:46.972 --> 00:05:49.767
Tsukimi? Are there any more potatoes?

00:05:52.019 --> 00:05:54.396
There's plenty more where these came from!

00:05:54.480 --> 00:05:58.025
Whoa! Can we borrow any one we want?

00:05:58.108 --> 00:06:02.488
I'm so happy you've awakened to
the wonders of the kimono, Tsukimi!

00:06:02.571 --> 00:06:04.990
Hey, this pattern's cute!

00:06:06.700 --> 00:06:08.118
You have a good eye.

00:06:08.202 --> 00:06:10.746
That's an antique sash
from the early Showa period

00:06:10.829 --> 00:06:13.832
that I got from the kimono
shop in Nishiogi I always go to.

00:06:13.916 --> 00:06:15.668
Isn't it in amazing shape?

00:06:15.751 --> 00:06:19.880
I doubt you'll find many sashes
of this age in as fine condition!

00:06:19.964 --> 00:06:22.049
It was originally a double-weave sash,

00:06:22.132 --> 00:06:25.761
but it's been remade as a
Nagoya-style one for easy everyday use,

00:06:25.844 --> 00:06:27.930
so you can pair it up with anything,
even truly intricate patterns!

00:06:28.013 --> 00:06:30.474
“Chieko, your expression is scary! --Yes, yes, if
we're going to pair it up, let's go all the way

00:06:30.558 --> 00:06:32.810
and use a collar with roses, too...

00:06:32.893 --> 00:06:37.231
Chieko, you put it on her. After all,
this boy sure doesn't know how.

00:06:37.314 --> 00:06:38.107
Ole'!

00:06:38.148 --> 00:06:44.071
<i>P</i> Ole', olé! Ba-da-da! Matsuken Samba! <i>P</i>

00:06:44.154 --> 00:06:46.740
<i>P Olé, olé, olé! P</i>

00:06:46.824 --> 00:06:48.617
Please stop saying "boy"!

00:06:48.701 --> 00:06:50.327
Okay, okay...

00:06:50.411 --> 00:06:54.790
Come, Tsukimi! To the rapturous
world of hedonistic pleasure!

00:06:55.874 --> 00:06:57.251
Oh darling brother!

00:06:59.378 --> 00:07:02.548
Lend us your Benz, won't you?

00:07:05.634 --> 00:07:08.470
Why are you the one driving?

00:07:08.554 --> 00:07:11.932
Hanamori is keeping Dad company
while he plays golf in Hakone.

00:07:13.434 --> 00:07:15.603
Fore!

00:07:20.566 --> 00:07:24.903
Your shots are especially nice today.

00:07:24.987 --> 00:07:28.949
Yeah, right! I bet you just came
along because Tsukimi's with me.

00:07:30.367 --> 00:07:31.201
Tsukimi...

00:07:31.285 --> 00:07:32.786
Uh, yes?!

00:07:32.870 --> 00:07:36.957
When I visited your home the
other day to return your glasses...

00:07:37.041 --> 00:07:40.377
I'm very sorry.

00:07:40.461 --> 00:07:44.089
I meant to deliver them directly
into your hands, but I wasn't able to.

00:07:44.173 --> 00:07:46.759
<i>Huh? He couldn't deliver them into my hands?</i>

00:07:48.385 --> 00:07:53.766
<i>Oh, I get it! I was so gross that
he couldn't stand to touch me!</i>

00:07:53.849 --> 00:07:55.017
Clara here!

00:07:55.100 --> 00:07:58.771
She decides she's gross even
though no one said anything of the sort.

00:07:58.854 --> 00:08:00.481
It's the kind of extravagant misinterpretation

00:08:00.564 --> 00:08:02.358
only an otaku girl could come up with!

00:08:04.234 --> 00:08:08.822
<i>But... I'm talking to him
without even getting nervous...</i>

00:08:08.906 --> 00:08:11.033
--Want some, Tsukimi?
--Is <i>it</i> because I'm not wearing my glasses?

00:08:11.033 --> 00:08:12.826
--You okay? You're spacing out.
--Is <i>it</i> because I'm not wearing my glasses?

00:08:14.370 --> 00:08:16.538
Wow, I'm impressed!

00:08:16.622 --> 00:08:19.583
I heard this place was popular lately, but this...

00:08:22.503 --> 00:08:24.213
Ts-Tsukimi...?

00:08:24.296 --> 00:08:27.549
Huh? Tsukimi's moving faster than usual...

00:08:27.633 --> 00:08:29.426
Tsukimi! Wait up!

00:08:31.762 --> 00:08:35.349
Let's go straight to the jellyfish room!

00:08:36.558 --> 00:08:38.352
This way! Hurry!

00:08:39.395 --> 00:08:41.397
She's like a different person.

00:08:46.402 --> 00:08:51.031
There are so many more spotted jellies!
Look at all the tiny ones!

00:08:51.115 --> 00:08:54.326
Dozens of jellies that are
just teensy compared to Clara!

00:08:54.410 --> 00:08:56.620
She looks so happy---

00:08:56.704 --> 00:09:00.082
I see Tsukimi is an admirable
woman who loves nature.

00:09:00.165 --> 00:09:03.085
Nope, she's just a jellyfish otaku!

00:09:03.168 --> 00:09:04.336
Tsukimi...

00:09:04.420 --> 00:09:06.004
Can you hear me?!

00:09:07.214 --> 00:09:13.178
Um, Mr. Older Brother? Would you
mind standing here like this for me?

00:09:17.015 --> 00:09:18.475
Like this?

00:09:18.559 --> 00:09:20.352
Yes! Now then...

00:09:23.522 --> 00:09:25.315
They really <i>do</i> look alike!

00:09:25.399 --> 00:09:30.529
I was right! Your brother looks
just like Sanderia malayensis,

00:09:30.612 --> 00:09:33.157
the prince of the jellyfish world!

00:09:33.240 --> 00:09:35.826
The long-tentacle feeling and everything!

00:09:35.909 --> 00:09:38.287
They project the same atmosphere!

00:09:41.415 --> 00:09:42.791
Um...

00:09:44.793 --> 00:09:46.170
What?

00:09:48.505 --> 00:09:51.300
Would you mind... would you mind just...

00:09:54.428 --> 00:09:56.597
...stepping to the side a little?

00:09:56.680 --> 00:09:59.558
I don't believe I've ever met this jelly before!

00:09:59.641 --> 00:10:02.102
Since I don't have my glasses,
I'd like to get right up against the tank!

00:10:02.186 --> 00:10:04.563
Sure, sure, I'm just gonna hit the bathroom.

00:10:06.940 --> 00:10:10.527
And I just waltz right into the ladies' room...

00:10:25.959 --> 00:10:28.545
Man, what am I even doing?

00:10:28.629 --> 00:10:30.547
Hey, what are you doing?!

00:10:30.631 --> 00:10:33.425
Th-This is the ladies' room, you know!

00:10:33.509 --> 00:10:35.177
Oh my, he's handsome!

00:10:35.260 --> 00:10:37.221
I'm sorry. I got confused.

00:10:38.680 --> 00:10:40.682
Be more careful next time, okay?

00:10:40.766 --> 00:10:44.144
<i>What's this about?
Why's she so cute right now'?</i>

00:10:46.355 --> 00:10:50.025
<i>Is it because this is my first
time ever seeing her have fun'?</i>

00:10:50.108 --> 00:10:52.152
<i>Oh, I get it. Now that I think about it,</i>

00:10:52.236 --> 00:10:56.198
<i>this is the first time Tsukimi's ever
made eye contact while we talked.</i>

00:11:03.747 --> 00:11:07.709
Huh? Why do I feel so... pissed off...?

00:11:08.794 --> 00:11:09.795
It's commercial time!

00:11:09.878 --> 00:11:11.088
Clara!

00:11:12.130 --> 00:11:13.298
It's the second half!

00:11:13.382 --> 00:11:13.966
Tequila!

00:11:14.091 --> 00:11:18.762
<i>In kindergarten, elementary school,
middle school, high school, college...</i>

00:11:18.846 --> 00:11:21.390
<i>Girls have always flocked to me.</i>

00:11:21.473 --> 00:11:23.475
<i>Scouts accost me on the street,</i>

00:11:23.559 --> 00:11:26.186
<i>and my pocket is always full of business cards:</i>

00:11:26.270 --> 00:11:29.648
<i>modeling agencies, pop idol
agencies, even record labels.</i>

00:11:29.731 --> 00:11:33.986
<i>The hottest girl at my high school,
the hottest girl at the next one down,</i>

00:11:34.069 --> 00:11:36.738
<i>and the beauty queens of
colleges all around town...</i>

00:11:36.822 --> 00:11:39.575
<i>They were all my girlfriends.</i>

00:11:39.658 --> 00:11:41.493
<i>I</i> was so popular--I was way too popular...

00:11:41.577 --> 00:11:43.579
...and <i>it</i> caused a lot of trouble sometimes...

00:11:43.662 --> 00:11:45.289
...and now I'm sick of women.

00:11:45.372 --> 00:11:49.167
Being popular is a giant pain
in the butt, and I've had enough.

00:11:50.878 --> 00:11:53.755
<i>So why should this scene...</i>

00:11:53.755 --> 00:11:58.594
"Member of Team Diet Secretary"

00:11:58.594 --> 00:11:58.844
--It's Shu-Shu! --between an fiber-uptight
four-eyed guy (member of Team Diet Secretary)

00:11:58.844 --> 00:12:03.599
"Member of the Sisterhood"

00:12:03.599 --> 00:12:03.682
--It's Tsukimi! --and a jellyfish-loving
otaku chick (member of the Sisterhood)

00:12:03.765 --> 00:12:08.645
make me--me, of all people-feel so pissed off?!

00:12:08.729 --> 00:12:10.522
Er...

00:12:13.692 --> 00:12:19.114
Excuse me, guys? You're in
public here. Time to move along.

00:12:19.197 --> 00:12:22.451
Break it up!

00:12:22.534 --> 00:12:25.913
What's wrong, Tsukimi? Why are you crying?

00:12:25.996 --> 00:12:28.206
Oh, your makeup's running!

00:12:28.290 --> 00:12:32.294
I'm sorry. I'll go wash up in the restroom.

00:12:32.377 --> 00:12:35.297
Aw, don't touch your eyes if you can help it!

00:12:35.380 --> 00:12:38.759
Well, her mascara's waterproof
today, so I guess it'll be okay.

00:12:41.970 --> 00:12:43.388
What was that all about?

00:12:43.472 --> 00:12:46.058
I... I don't know.

00:12:46.141 --> 00:12:49.853
Don't give me that! Just how old are you?!

00:12:49.937 --> 00:12:51.897
Th-Thirty...

00:12:51.980 --> 00:12:54.524
The son and secretary of a famous politician,

00:12:54.608 --> 00:12:57.486
hanging all over a girl ten
years his junior in a public place?!

00:12:57.569 --> 00:12:59.613
I'm gonna report you!

00:12:59.696 --> 00:13:02.074
Wait! I-It wasn't like that.

00:13:02.157 --> 00:13:06.244
It's just... She started crying all of a sudden...

00:13:06.328 --> 00:13:10.999
...and I didn't know what to do, so...
I ended up hugging her...

00:13:11.083 --> 00:13:14.044
She said watching the
jellyfish made her remember.

00:13:21.802 --> 00:13:28.058
I'm sorry, Tsukimi. I'll... be watching you, okay?

00:13:28.141 --> 00:13:32.104
I'll be watching over you from heaven forever.

00:13:32.187 --> 00:13:35.983
So don't cry... okay, Tsukimi?

00:13:40.404 --> 00:13:42.823
Are you all right?

00:13:42.906 --> 00:13:47.869
I'm sorry... These weren't
here last time I came...

00:13:50.956 --> 00:13:53.041
Ts-Ts-Tsukimi--

00:13:53.125 --> 00:13:55.752
I shouldn't cry!

00:13:55.836 --> 00:13:57.963
When my... mother...

00:13:58.046 --> 00:13:59.047
What?

00:13:59.131 --> 00:14:04.511
I promised her... I wouldn't cry when she died...!

00:14:08.223 --> 00:14:10.017
It's all right.

00:14:10.100 --> 00:14:13.270
You can cry. It's all right.

00:14:29.619 --> 00:14:31.413
<i>I feel</i> a <i>little calmer now.</i>

00:14:33.707 --> 00:14:36.501
<i>Wait... What just happened to me?</i>

00:14:38.795 --> 00:14:41.423
<i>Ts-Ts-Tsukimi--</i>

00:14:41.423 --> 00:14:42.799
"Sensation on Tsukimi's Back"

00:14:42.799 --> 00:14:43.175
<i>It's all right.</i>

00:14:43.175 --> 00:14:45.302
"Full-Body Sensation"

00:14:45.302 --> 00:14:45.594
<i>You can cry. It's all right.</i>

00:14:45.677 --> 00:14:50.390
<i>Wh-What are these thermography-style
sensory temperature memories?</i>

00:14:50.474 --> 00:14:55.896
<i>A</i> warmth on my back...
and my shoulders... and my ch-cheek...

00:14:55.979 --> 00:14:59.441
<i>...and</i> a <i>coolness like the
side of someone's glasses...!</i>

00:14:59.524 --> 00:15:03.361
Could I... <i>could</i> Kuranosuke's big brother have...

00:15:03.445 --> 00:15:05.822
...hu-hu-hu--!

00:15:08.450 --> 00:15:11.453
<i>H-He hugged me?!</i>

00:15:11.536 --> 00:15:14.331
<i>What for'?! Why?! What for'?!</i>

00:15:15.957 --> 00:15:19.878
<i>Oh, was it because I was
sobbing like a baby in public?</i>

00:15:19.961 --> 00:15:24.299
<i>I was disturbing other
people, so it was basically</i> a...

00:15:24.382 --> 00:15:27.594
--... "Mutsugoro <i>"</i> sort of thing? --There,
there, good girl. You're scared, aren't you?

00:15:27.677 --> 00:15:33.266
At times like this, you hold the
animal in your arms, which results in...

00:15:34.351 --> 00:15:37.062
<i>What a kind man!</i>

00:15:37.145 --> 00:15:40.732
Miss, your nose is bleeding.

00:15:40.816 --> 00:15:44.236
No worries, I'm used to
being in the girls' bathroom.

00:15:44.319 --> 00:15:49.116
Here, wipe your nose, wipe
your face, pat down your kimono,

00:15:49.199 --> 00:15:51.159
and... snap!

00:15:56.164 --> 00:15:57.332
I seal thee!

00:16:03.380 --> 00:16:07.843
<i>It's no good... When I can see him,
I'm too nervous to say anything!</i>

00:16:07.926 --> 00:16:09.177
Tsukimi.

00:16:09.261 --> 00:16:10.554
Er, yes?

00:16:10.637 --> 00:16:16.601
I'm sorry. I didn't know about your mom.

00:16:18.770 --> 00:16:23.024
No, I should apologize for
making such an embarrassing scene...

00:16:23.108 --> 00:16:25.652
See, I understand.

00:16:25.735 --> 00:16:27.696
I understand how you feel.

00:16:35.287 --> 00:16:39.207
U-Um, I'm indebted to
you for your kindness today!

00:16:39.291 --> 00:16:41.751
L-I caused you so much trouble...

00:16:41.835 --> 00:16:43.587
Well then, please excuse me!

00:16:43.670 --> 00:16:46.882
<i>Good, putting glasses on her broke the spell,</i>

00:16:46.965 --> 00:16:49.634
<i>and she turned back into a Sister.</i>

00:16:49.718 --> 00:16:53.305
<i>Hey, why do I think that's "good"?</i>

00:16:57.309 --> 00:16:59.186
Emergency! Emergency!

00:16:59.269 --> 00:17:00.687
We'll call it "emergy" for short!

00:17:00.770 --> 00:17:03.565
The tip of my calligraphy pen wore out!

00:17:03.648 --> 00:17:04.399
What?

00:17:04.441 --> 00:17:06.943
Tsukimi! You're late!

00:17:07.027 --> 00:17:09.905
We have a situation.
Come to the reception hall, quickly!

00:17:09.988 --> 00:17:12.782
It's a decree from Ms. Mejiro!

00:17:14.618 --> 00:17:16.995
Banba, do all the solid black here, too.

00:17:17.078 --> 00:17:17.704
Okay.

00:17:17.746 --> 00:17:19.623
This hasn't been inked at all!

00:17:19.706 --> 00:17:24.544
Gah! Banba, your hair! You've got ink on it!

00:17:24.628 --> 00:17:28.798
They're sold out of my brand!

00:17:28.882 --> 00:17:32.886
Gah! Jiji! Stop drawing in extra old men!

00:17:32.969 --> 00:17:34.888
You're a good artist.

00:17:34.971 --> 00:17:36.264
My calligraphy pen!

00:17:36.348 --> 00:17:38.642
--Correction fluid only works
right with Sailor-brand pens!

00:17:38.642 --> 00:17:40.977
“Honestly, you people are no help at all... "Correction
fluid only works right with Sailor-brand pens!

00:17:41.061 --> 00:17:44.689
Tsukimi, go get changed.
You're the only battle-ready troop I've got!

00:17:44.773 --> 00:17:45.732
Yes, Ma'am!

00:17:47.442 --> 00:17:50.654
Huh? I don't know how to take this off.

00:17:50.737 --> 00:17:52.948
If I untie this part...

00:17:53.031 --> 00:17:55.617
Huh?! I don't get kimonos at all!

00:17:57.118 --> 00:17:58.745
Tsukimi, hurry!

00:17:58.828 --> 00:18:00.538
My pen!

00:18:00.622 --> 00:18:04.042
Gah! Banba knocked over the inkwell!

00:18:04.125 --> 00:18:05.168
My pen!

00:18:05.252 --> 00:18:08.213
Fine, I'll just force it off!

00:18:11.174 --> 00:18:15.929
Gah! Jiji blissed out
mooning over her own drawings!

00:18:16.012 --> 00:18:18.223
It's just no use!

00:18:18.306 --> 00:18:22.686
Chieko! I can't figure out how to take this off!

00:18:27.899 --> 00:18:30.777
I apologize for my rudeness today.

00:18:30.860 --> 00:18:32.696
That's all I wanted to say.

00:18:32.779 --> 00:18:34.155
Good night.

00:18:48.044 --> 00:18:49.004
You too?!

00:18:51.006 --> 00:18:54.384
What's with you two,
getting nosebleeds like that?

00:18:54.467 --> 00:18:57.470
All you did was hug!

00:18:57.554 --> 00:19:00.974
Hey, hold on...

00:19:01.057 --> 00:19:06.146
<i>When I first came to this
place, Shu was in high school.</i>

00:19:06.229 --> 00:19:09.858
<i>We've lived under the
same roof for over ten years,</i>

00:19:09.941 --> 00:19:13.320
<i>but now that I think about it,
I've never seen him with</i> a <i>girlfriend.</i>

00:19:18.408 --> 00:19:21.202
Mr. Prime Minister, this is
tomorrow's morning edition.

00:19:21.202 --> 00:19:21.286
"Approval Rating Falls to 9%"

00:19:21.369 --> 00:19:23.330
"Saburota Negishi"

00:19:23.663 --> 00:19:25.206
How's the front entrance?

00:19:25.290 --> 00:19:27.792
Reporters from the papers and
TV news stations are swarming it.

00:19:27.876 --> 00:19:32.047
I see... Then perhaps
tonight's dinner should be cance--

00:19:37.969 --> 00:19:40.138
Jello, Kura-pyon!

00:19:40.221 --> 00:19:42.932
Is that you, Uncle? Sorry,
I know this is a rough time.

00:19:43.016 --> 00:19:46.978
Hey, no worries! I've still got 9%, baby!

00:19:47.062 --> 00:19:49.606
<i>P</i> Nine! Nine! And my head sure shines! <i>P</i>

00:19:49.689 --> 00:19:53.193
You and Bro have always
been pretty tight, right?

00:19:53.276 --> 00:19:55.945
Oh, yeah! Sing it, brother!

00:19:56.029 --> 00:19:59.324
Have you ever heard him talk about women?

00:19:59.407 --> 00:20:01.743
I've never seen a girlfriend of his or anything...

00:20:01.826 --> 00:20:05.205
I was wondering if this place is so
strict he doesn't bring them home?

00:20:05.288 --> 00:20:07.248
Whatchoo talkin' about, Kura-pyon?

00:20:07.332 --> 00:20:09.501
Shu-Shu's a virgin!

00:20:09.584 --> 00:20:11.961
One of those middle-aged
virgins that are so "in" these days!

00:20:17.092 --> 00:20:18.593
How many more pages?

00:20:18.676 --> 00:20:20.970
Tsukimi's doing the last one.

00:20:21.054 --> 00:20:22.305
Hurry it UP!

00:20:22.389 --> 00:20:26.768
Stake your life on that page, that pen, Tsukimi!

00:20:26.851 --> 00:20:27.435
--Unleash a torrent of
ardent pathos! With that pen!

00:20:27.435 --> 00:20:30.230
"Oh, he saw me! --Unleash a torrent
of ardent pathos! VVith that pen!

00:20:30.313 --> 00:20:32.982
<i>He saw me stripped down to
the gross, shabby old tank top</i>

00:20:33.066 --> 00:20:36.111
<i>that I've been wearing since high school!</i>

00:20:36.194 --> 00:20:38.488
No bra... no life?

00:20:38.571 --> 00:20:40.490
Nooooooo!

00:20:40.573 --> 00:20:43.284
Gah! What are you doing, Tsukimi?!

00:20:43.368 --> 00:20:44.452
--There's ink all over the art!
--No! No! Someone erase my memories!

00:20:44.452 --> 00:20:46.287
--| need something to wipe it up with, quickly!
--No! No! Someone erase my memories!

00:20:46.287 --> 00:20:48.331
--Cloth! Cloth!
--No! No! Someone erase my memories!

00:20:48.415 --> 00:20:50.792
We'll use Banba's hair!

00:20:50.875 --> 00:20:53.420
Mayaya, you're making it worse!

00:20:53.503 --> 00:20:54.796
What's wrong, Tsukimi?!

00:20:54.879 --> 00:20:57.048
--A-Are you okay?
--No! I can't take it!

00:20:57.132 --> 00:20:58.633
You're pale as a ghost!

00:20:58.716 --> 00:21:01.678
Or in 1980s terms, majorly pale!

00:21:05.223 --> 00:21:07.725
<i>I</i> can't <i>take this, Mom.</i>

00:21:07.809 --> 00:21:11.062
<i>When you get right down to it,
didn't I... didn't I basically...</i>

00:21:11.146 --> 00:21:14.816
...get jealous of a love <i>scene</i>
between a couple of virgins?!

00:21:14.899 --> 00:21:16.443
No!

00:21:16.526 --> 00:21:19.487
I can't take it!

00:21:21.281 --> 00:21:30.290
<i>Hontou ni kizuite hoshii n da,
anata ga utsukushii tte koto wo</i>

00:21:30.373 --> 00:21:34.711
Ima made naze kizukanai no sa

00:21:34.794 --> 00:21:39.215
<i>Kokoro nakushita mitai da yo</i>

00:21:39.299 --> 00:21:48.391
<i>Sugu ni sugu ni kizuite hoshii, wakatte hoshii yo</i>

00:21:48.475 --> 00:22:02.864
<i>Sugu ni kimi ni kizuite hoshii,
kimi no kirei ni kizuite hoshii yo</i>

00:22:04.240 --> 00:22:08.703
Anata <i>ga</i> totemo kirei dakara

00:22:08.786 --> 00:22:12.790
Anata ni sore wo tsutaetai no sa

00:22:12.874 --> 00:22:22.467
<i>ltsumademo, itsumademo kimi utsukushisa wo</i>

00:22:22.550 --> 00:22:30.892
Anata <i>ga</i> jibun no utsukushisa ni
kizuitara boku <i>wa</i> shiawase nan da

00:22:30.975 --> 00:22:35.688
<i>Boku wa kimi wo omotteru yo</i>

00:22:35.772 --> 00:22:45.031
<i>Kimi no kirei ni kizuite okure</i>
